  "description": {
    "raw": "All targets are rendered silent, as per silence. The silence affects the entirety of each creature but does not extend beyond. However, the silence is one-way—sounds from outside the creatures’ spaces can still enter. Quieted creatures gain a +10 circumstance bonus on Stealth checks.",
